  "notes": "subject: recipient is evaluated against the effective recipient. The question only rules out a future date; the 18-or-over rule is the business's eligibility decision, so a child's birth date is a valid answer that yields ineligible rather than an invalid answer. An adult buyer booking for a 12-year-old is ineligible for an adults-only service; the same buyer booking for themselves is eligible, so self-bookings never lack a subject.",
